      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA KEEP UP (1) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fourth (30.33) in a Mix 6/7 at Sandown. Generally fast into stride but was shuffled back from the tricky draw last time. Comes through a solid form race last start. Ready to return to form. INCLINATION (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.18) at The Meadows behind Paw Raelia in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Form from his last run is proving strong. Expected to be in the finish again. HOLMES (4) scored (29.68) last time out at Sandown adding to an already respectable career. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. SOLID GROOVE (8) is worth some thought after being close-up last start.",
